# The PDA writing zone (report 041, 042) as the text input of a native page: Settings has no text field (the band
# hidden); Settings > System > Keyboard test (development channel) focuses its Text field, so the band shows where the
# on-screen keyboard would (vkb=zone), and the field is written with pen strokes through the touch path, the router and
# the recogniser with the shipped tables. The strokes are the shipped templates drawn about 12 mm high in the
# boxes (points in px from the box's corner). Shots: the mode line after the shift gesture ("Abc", Shift), after the
# extended prefix (Ext), the field with "Lit £1" (a pound sign through the extended set: no US key, typed as text alone;
# the field shows it), a stroke in progress (its ink), and a dead accent (the acute stroke: the mode line says so) put
# on the next letter (i: an i with an acute accent, U+00ED, typed as text alone); the Password field opens the band on
# the on-screen keyboard (report 042: an exact input; vkb=auto), the Text field again on the writing boxes; then Esc ends
# the editing and the band hides (the page gets the whole panel, vkb=auto).
# Goldens at both sizes.
title zone text
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
expect_zone hidden
key UP
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
expect_zone shown
expect_vkb zone
stroke letters 60,130 60,30
shot zone_text_shift
stroke letters 60,30 60,130 121,130
stroke letters 60,30 60,130
stroke letters 60,30 118,30 121,130
stroke letters 40,80 140,80
stroke letters 60,30 145,115
shot zone_text_ext
stroke letters 60,30 60,130 121,130
stroke digits 50,30 50,130
expect_text "Lit £1"
shot zone_text
stroke letters 120,30 120,90 hold
shot zone_ink
release
expect_text "Lit £1i"
stroke letters 34,130 101,30 20,127
shot zone_text_accent
stroke letters 60,30 60,130
expect_text "Lit £1ií"
key DOWN
key DOWN
expect_zone keys
expect_vkb auto
shot zone_text_password
key UP
key UP
expect_zone writing
expect_vkb zone
key ESC
expect_zone hidden
expect_vkb auto
shot zone_text_done
